  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Brendan McAssey is an Australian businessman who founded Only About Children after a career in investment banking. He developed campuses in Sydney and Melbourne, combining childcare with education and health services. Bain Capital bought a majority stake in 2016, with McAssey retaining a minority interest. He also founded Beluga Capital.",
    "html": "<p>Brendan McAssey is an Australian businessman who founded Only About Children after a career in investment banking. He developed campuses in Sydney and Melbourne, combining childcare with education and health services. Bain Capital bought a majority stake in 2016, with McAssey retaining a minority interest. He also founded Beluga Capital.</p>\r\n",
